<div>
    <div class=3D"cmp-text ">
        <h3>Rethinking technology talent: A rise of AI translators</h3>
<p>In the United States, some investment firms are also seeking talent with=
 AI expertise, signaling a change in industry priorities. Job postings that=
 referenced artificial intelligence rose by almost 25% from 2022 to the fir=
st half of 2025 alone.<sup><a id=3D"endnote-sup-46" href=3D"https://www.del=
oitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/financial-services/financial-services-ind=
ustry-outlooks/investment-management-industry-outlook.html#endnote-46" aria=
-label=3D"Endnotes reference number 46">46</a></sup> While the absolute num=
bers may appear modest, the growth is considerable: AI is now featured in 2=
.4% of all US job postings by industry firms, up from 0.7% in 2022.<sup><a =
id=3D"endnote-sup-47" href=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/indus=
try/financial-services/financial-services-industry-outlooks/investment-mana=
gement-industry-outlook.html#endnote-47" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference n=
umber 47">47</a></sup> Within a broader surge, references to specific techn=
ologies can highlight how quickly the field is evolving. A recent Deloitte =
survey found that 43% of financial services firms with high generative AI e=
xpertise gave access to over 40% of their workforce=E2=80=94compared to jus=
t 19% of firms with lower expertise doing the same.<sup><a id=3D"endnote-su=
p-48" href=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/financial-se=
rvices/financial-services-industry-outlooks/investment-management-industry-=
outlook.html#endnote-48" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference number 48">48</a>=
</sup> This may signify that organizations with more employees adopting the=
 technology tend to achieve greater success.</p>
<p>Indeed, mentions of generative AI grew from a single posting in 2022 to =
288 by mid-2025; similar growth has occurred in mentions of large language =
models and even the once-obscure skill of prompt engineering.<sup><a id=3D"=
endnote-sup-49" href=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/fi=
nancial-services/financial-services-industry-outlooks/investment-management=
-industry-outlook.html#endnote-49" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference number =
49">49</a></sup> In fact, the demand for AI and prompt engineering talent i=
s leading to the integration of liberal arts graduates into investment team=
s, reflecting recognition that critical thinking and creativity can be powe=
rful complements to technical expertise.<sup><a id=3D"endnote-sup-50" href=
=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/financial-services/fin=
ancial-services-industry-outlooks/investment-management-industry-outlook.ht=
ml#endnote-50" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference number 50">50</a></sup></p>
<p>The arrival of generative AI in 2022 has led to transformation both in h=
iring and training: 66% of C-suite and board member respondents to a cross-=
industry Deloitte survey say that their organizations are leveraging AI to =
boost productivity and efficiency.<sup><a id=3D"endnote-sup-51" href=3D"htt=
ps://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/financial-services/financial-=
services-industry-outlooks/investment-management-industry-outlook.html#endn=
ote-51" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference number 51">51</a></sup> AI is help=
ing redefine the role of professionals, often shifting focus from manual da=
ta processing to delivering strategic insights. AI tools are often seen as =
accelerators, with human oversight remaining essential.<sup><a id=3D"endnot=
e-sup-52" href=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/financia=
l-services/financial-services-industry-outlooks/investment-management-indus=
try-outlook.html#endnote-52" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference number 52">52=
</a></sup> Firms are increasingly seeking professionals with strong digital=
 fluency=E2=80=94those able to translate AI outputs and convert them into a=
ctionable insights. Meanwhile, autonomous AI agents and protocols for multi=
-agent collaboration are emerging in some cases.<sup><a id=3D"endnote-sup-5=
3" href=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/financial-servi=
ces/financial-services-industry-outlooks/investment-management-industry-out=
look.html#endnote-53" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference number 53">53</a></s=
up></p>

    </div>
